      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "The studies were eligible for inclusion if they met the following criteria: (1) Patients who suffered and were treated for an extra-articular distal radius fracture; (2) age 18 years or older; (3) patients were either treated using a plaster cast, K-wire(s), plate fixation, external fixator, or an intramedullary device; (4) primary data for at least one outcome parameter had to be available.",
      "reason": "The manuscript specifies the inclusion criteria regarding patient population (extra-articular distal radius fracture, age 18+), interventions (plaster cast, K-wire, plate, external fixator, intramedullary device), and data availability."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_4",
      "quote": "No language limits were used and any potentially eligible non-English language manuscripts were translated if possible by native speaking colleagues or using Google translate, if no native speaker was available.",
      "reason": "The manuscript specifies language eligibility criteria (no language limits)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The review does not explicitly discuss distinguishing between exclusion due to outcomes not being measured versus not being reported; this is not a required reporting element unless relevant to the specific review's exclusion process."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "All outcome data were pooled for four different follow-up periods: 0-3 months, > 3-6 months, > 6-12 months, and 12 months or longer (long term).",
      "reason": "The manuscript specifies how studies were grouped for synthesis (by treatment modality and follow-up period)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "Studies describing a not-commonly used device or technique for extra-articular fractures were excluded ( i.e. dorsal plates, Epibloc system, cannulated screw, above elbow cast, etc.).",
      "reason": "The manuscript provides a rationale for the exclusion of studies describing non-commonly used devices or techniques."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
}

